## 9. Be careful with bounded limits

A query such as:

```text
.limit(200)
```

is not automatically a pagination defect.

Distinguish between:

### Intentional application limit

Example:

> "Analyze the most recent 200 Judge decisions."

and:

### Accidental truncation

Example:

> "Analyze all available Judge decisions."

where the code happens to retrieve only the first Supabase page.

This distinction is central to this investigation.

